Windows Registry Editor Version 5.00

; Proton's tabtip.exe (the Steam Deck on-screen keyboard helper) watches every
; window through UI Automation. With Altium's WPF windows that turns into an
; endless loop: Altium freezes, draws black boxes and leaks ~55 MB/s. Disable it.
[HKEY_CURRENT_USER\Software\Wine\DllOverrides]
"tabtip.exe"=""

; WPF software rendering. WPF on DXVK's d3d9 can draw black windows.
[HKEY_CURRENT_USER\Software\Microsoft\Avalon.Graphics]
"DisableHWAcceleration"=dword:00000001

; Load the SHFolder.dll proxy from Altium's folder instead of Wine's builtin.
[HKEY_CURRENT_USER\Software\Wine\AppDefaults\X2.EXE\DllOverrides]
"shfolder"="native,builtin"
